ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管向法院申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密窃取诉讼</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Midjourney正式发布V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布全新 Qoder：从 AI 编程 IDE 升级为面向全员的智能体工作台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09bcf9a64753367ba069c7a1f7b80e38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月27日，阿里正式发布全新 Qoder，将原 AI 编程 IDE 升级为以 Coding 为底座、面向全员的智能体工作台。该产品支持用户通过自然语言描述目标，由智能体自主完成计划制定、工具调用、执行及验证。技术层面，Qoder 搭载 Harness 长链路执行底座，实现“读—改—验证—迭代”闭环，具备跨文件编辑、自纠错及长期记忆能力。模型侧内置海内外 SOTA 模型并深度适配 Qwen 系列，通过 Auto 智能路由平衡性能与成本。产品提供编程与通用双模式，集成 40+ 连接器、70+ 插件及 20K+ 技能，支持 Browser Use 与 Computer Use 操作。交互上新增桌面常驻与语音唤起，实现从“人驱动”到“智能体主动提醒”的转变。即日起，Qoder 国际版与中国版同步上线，个人用户可领 Qw</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布770B旗舰模型Hy4preview并正式开源</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f10b20ccca5c57985cdeb65a0b1f2992.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元团队正式发布全新一代旗舰模型预览版Hy4preview，该模型总参数量达770B，激活参数为49B，支持1M上下文长度。Hy4preview在代码开发、办公分析、游戏开发及科学研究等生产力场景表现卓越，内部盲测综合性能优于同类竞品。在技术指标上，其端到端吞吐量较基线提升31.8%；在科学前沿领域，该模型在凝聚态物理器件设计及三维Blaschke–Lebesgue几何难题求解上取得重大突破。目前，Hy4preview已全面开源，并上线腾讯云TokenHub与OpenRouter平台，用户可通过元宝、ima等产品进行体验。腾讯混元团队将基于用户反馈加速模型迭代，持续推进正式版升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管向法院申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密窃取诉讼</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cf14f2030f6c7ab1f5117bbe659e7142.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月27日，OpenAI联合苹果前高管唐坦（Tang Tan）、刘畅（Chang Liu）及Jony Ive创办的io Products，向法院提交请愿书，请求“带偏见地驳回”（dismiss with prejudice）苹果公司提起的商业秘密窃取诉讼，旨在彻底阻止苹果未来就相同事由再次起诉。此前，苹果指控刘畅与唐坦在离职跳槽过程中非法获取并泄露公司机密，并涉嫌指导求职者规避安保审查。OpenAI在最新法律回应中反击称，苹果的诉状存在根本性事实缺陷，未能根据《保护商业秘密法》（DTSA）清晰界定商业秘密或提供确凿的非法挪用证据，仅以主观推测进行指控。目前双方诉辩状提交已结束，法院定于10月1日召开动议听证会。此案不仅涉及顶尖人才流动与核心技术产权的法律博弈，其最终裁决也将对硅谷技术人员流动及AI生态中的知识产</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Midjourney正式发布V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ee1ede5743f536d7e046c8acad8c0b4c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Midjourney近日正式上线V8.2图像编辑模型，标志着其从单一文本生成向精准图像编辑的重大转型。该模型核心支持四大技术特性：一是基于文本指令的图像修改；二是全新的多图参考机制，单次最多支持融合4张图片；三是支持局部重绘（inpainting）与画布扩展（outpainting）；四是全面兼容个性化设置、情绪板及风格参考（srefs）。用户可通过拖拽图片至提示词框、点击预览灯箱“编辑”按钮或Discord指令调用该模型。目前该功能已在官网及alpha.midjourney.com同步开启测试。官方表示，V8.2处于功能测试初期，界面将随实验性优化快速迭代，并鼓励用户通过任务ID反馈复杂边缘情况下的生成表现，以辅助模型后续改进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4c5210c4ae4e9870b5fe8584c0f7bf48.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于8月27日以研究预览形式推出模型硬件标准（MHS），标志其正式切入具身智能与物理AI赛道。MHS本质是一套统一的控制与通信标准，充当AI智能体与物理设备间的“翻译层”，支持AI在无需人工干预下操控显微镜、液体处理器、机械臂及量子计算设备。该标准旨在让AI系统具备感知物理世界、执行复杂动作及持续学习的能力。在早期闭门测试中，MHS表现出显著的提速效应，制药巨头基因泰克通过该技术实现多台异构实验设备联动，将全自动剂量反应曲线实验的开发与运行周期缩短至原来的三分之一。此次发布意味着Anthropic将大模型应用边界从数字对话拓展至实体产线，推动AI从“对话”向“动手”演进，对生物医药、先进制造等硬科技领域具有重要行业影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
